# ── Seeds ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# There is no API key here, and no account to create: this server holds TOTP
# seeds and computes codes from them. A seed comes from the service you are
# enabling two-factor on — `npm profile enable-2fa auth-and-writes` prints an
# otpauth:// URI — and goes in through totp_import_uri, which files it in the
# macOS login keychain.
#
# TOTP_SECRET_<LABEL> is the escape hatch for a machine with no keychain:
# Docker, CI, or Linux. Either an otpauth:// URI or a bare base32 secret. The
# label is the part after the prefix, lower-cased, so TOTP_SECRET_NPM is the
# seed totp_get_code { label: "npm" } reads.
#
# Seeds resolve ENVIRONMENT FIRST, then the keychain, per label — so a seed set
# here beats whatever the machine holds, without editing anything.
#
# ⚠ A seed is the whole second factor, not a hint about one. A container holding
# this variable alongside that account's password or token holds both halves.
# TOTP_SECRET_NPM=otpauth://totp/npmjs:you?secret=...&issuer=npmjs

# Which keychain service the seeds are filed under. Defaults to
# com.mgcrea.mcp-totp. Change it only to keep two installs apart on one machine.
TOTP_KEYCHAIN_SERVICE=com.mgcrea.mcp-totp

# ── Safety ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Set to 1 to register the WRITE tools: totp_import_uri, totp_import_from_export
# and totp_remove. Off by default: with the flag unset the mutating tools are
# not merely refused, they are never registered, so an agent cannot call them at
# all. totp_remove additionally requires confirm: true — a deleted seed is gone,
# and re-enrolling means going back to the service and rotating its 2FA.
#
# Reading is unaffected: totp_get_code works with this off, which is the state
# a server that only mints codes should run in.
TOTP_ALLOW_WRITES=

# ── Optional tuning ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Set to 1 to log debug output to stderr. Never to stdout: that is the MCP
# protocol channel.
TOTP_DEBUG=
